@Balanced.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5102

### Deposit for Alice
POST {{Balanced.Api_HostAddress}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "amount": 10.00,
  "provider": "stripe"
}

### Withdraw for Alice
POST {{Balanced.Api_HostAddress}}/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "amount": 5.00,
  "provider": "paypal"
}

### Get Alice balance
GET {{Balanced.Api_HostAddress}}/customers/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/balance
